        {
          "text": "Nanka muntu uuampa cintu neciba cimwi cisofweede, mbuli mutunta wamunyama uusofweede na mutunta waŋombe zisofweede na mutunta wabauka basofweede, alimwi makani alisiseme, aboobo wasofwaazigwa, ulijisi mulandu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.5.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.5.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
