          "text": "Alimwi kufumbwa cintu ncaakaluba, aciboozye akubika cipanzi casanu alincico. Acilete kumupaizi, lino mupaizi amanye mulandu wakwe amugutu wacituuzyo candubo kuti alekelelwe,",
