        {
          "text": "Alete mugutu uutakwe kampenda wakumatanga aakwe, mbuli muulo ngobika, cibe cipaizyo candubo, Acilete kumupaizi, kuti mupaizi amanye mulandu wandubo zyakwe nzyaakalubya cakutaziba, aboobo ulalekelelwa. ",
